Z||000016||whamel||08-28-2000||10:17 PM||||Well, my shop called me on my GT and they told me that it has the following problems right now:<BR>slight radiator leak, slight (very small) oil leak, heater core is leaky, a couple exhaust leaks, and a bunch of other things that they fixed (bad ground, bad belts, tach, temp gauge, etc. etc.), but they did deem it to be quite roadworthy after that!  So this means I should actually be coming to the event in a Fiero!  (Whew!)  It's going to be rough, but I would have hated to drive the truck instead.||||reg||1
Z||000017||Oreif||08-29-2000||02:53 AM||||Sloponti ~ There are awards for each class. <BR>so yes there will be many winners. Yes there will be parts on hand. Rodney will be there, Bob Steiger will be there, Archie will be there, and usually other folks bring parts to sell as well. The event is just Sunday. It ends at 5pm. You have until noon to register.||||reg||1
